      "text": "Obviously, this is a continuation of the life and legacy of David. If you have not taken the time to read through 1&2 Samuel, I would highly recommend going through them (or at least 2 Samuel) in order to get the full context of events taking place here. When reading scripture, context is always key, even if you have to read multiple books to get the proper context. Thankfully, for these books, you don't have to travel too far to get the full context.",
